weaknesses=[
{'id':'A01','problem':'Paired orders do not by themselves test directional hypothesis or forecast skill.','fix':'Keep source-directed strategy identity and target-specific forecast scoring;new paired arms partition by causal indicator/output context. Compare across retained cells,never claim identical unconditional pair returns establish model differences.'},
{'id':'A02','problem':'Same inclusion does not mean same order directions/horizons for different scientific targets.','fix':'Uniform attribution,availability,execution/reporting policy;preserve original target/clock/horizon;target-type translations explicitly new.'},
{'id':'A03','problem':'Retrospective source family phase cannot schedule live opportunity.','fix':'Keep historical phase as provenance/outcome;model1s causal sampler new. Never wait for future family birth then backdate entry.'},
{'id':'A04','problem':'Hypothesis unavailable trigger and false trigger are different;both can disappear if ledger emitted only on true.','fix':'Create opportunity before evaluating input-dependent condition. UNKNOWN=>INPUT_UNAVAILABLE;false=>NO_TRIGGER;true with adapter issue=>NO_ENTRY_REASON. No returns invented for any no-fill.'},
{'id':'A05','problem':'Expected model field missingness differs from provider/whole-source failure.','fix':'Use exact original prep masks/imputation for legitimate field states. Track physical missing provider as separate contract limitation. Do not indiscriminately block every incomplete numeric row or silently manufacture a whole provider.'},
{'id':'A06','problem':'Late input/prediction can outlive original target.','fix':'Preserve immutable origin and target deadline. Submit only before deadline;no reset. Lifecycle original clock is earliest eligible quote+h,not actual fill+h. Additional fill-relative variant new.'},
{'id':'A07','problem':'Finite output outside target support is neither missing nor ordinary valid forecast.','fix':'Retain finite raw output and explicit invalid-support tag;target contexts still defined;score where mathematically meaningful. Logloss undefined outside(0,1);no new clipping. Inherited source clamp logged as source transform.'},
{'id':'A08','problem':'Opposing paper arms in netted account interfere and can produce no genuine independent result.','fix':'Separate platform accounts or deterministic separately replayed platform trials;one arm must never close another. Platform reports alone authorize fill status. Per-arm opportunity ledger remains even under limits.'},
{'id':'A09','problem':'Rules can silently turn into repeated entries every group while predicate stays true.','fix':'Source LC03 edge semantics exact;other continuous new framework predicates use explicit first false-to-true edge,reset on false,unless declared update/per-prefix opportunity. UNKNOWN resets computability and never supplies false evidence.'},
{'id':'A10','problem':'Outcomes/censoring selection can make survivors look successful.','fix':'Retain all sides/cells/sources/versions/folds,overlap,no-fill,partial-fill,expired,rejected,window-end. Invalid/unknown target separate from zero target. Exact future target used only by delayed scoring.'},
{'id':'A11','problem':'Feature proxies could replace original unimplemented hypothesis unnoticed.','fix':'NF/PF new operational recipes linked alongside original unresolved formula. Hawkes/invariance/dealer-gamma etc stay unavailable absent irreducible states;proxy variants explicitly new and do not certify source theory.'},
{'id':'A12','problem':'A rule expression references indicators whose causal implementation does not exist.','fix':'This file supplies expression+operand specification only. Missing upstream producer/feed or platform adapter remains explicit. Never label JSON runnable as fully connected platform strategy.'}]
